  "entries": [
    {
      "ordinal": 0,
      "label": "sdc01_0040_student1_01",
      "hash64": "8EF4D37E104353CA",
      "text": "Endlich haben wir’s geschafft...\\nWir sind da!",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 1,
      "label": "sdc01_0040_student2_01",
      "hash64": "3CE71399CB93CFBD",
      "text": "Boah, mein Hintern tut richtig weh vom langen\\nSitzen. Erst der Flieger und dann noch der Bus...",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 2,
      "label": "sdc01_0040_bbteacher_01",
      "hash64": "EC547B8D853E0202",
      "text": "Hahaha! Ja, das war wirklich eine lange Reise.[VAR 0x0114(0042)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 46,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0042"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 3,
      "label": "sdc01_0040_bbteacher_02",
      "hash64": "EC547A8D853E004F",
      "text": "Aber wir haben niemanden unterwegs verloren,\\nrichtig? Sind noch alle da?[VAR 0x0114(0042)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 72,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0042"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 4,
      "label": "sdc01_0040_students_01",
      "hash64": "BD78057B68BC1668",
      "text": "Jaaa!",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 5,
      "label": "sdc01_0040_bbteacher_03",
      "hash64": "EC54798D853DFE9C",
      "text": "Wenn das so ist: Willkommen in Kitakami![VAR 0x0114(0042)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 40,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0042"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 6,
      "label": "sdc01_0040_bbteacher_04",
      "hash64": "EC54788D853DFCE9",
      "text": "Hier werden wir während unserer Exkursion\\ndie Zeit verbringen![VAR 0x0114(0042)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 62,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0042"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 7,
      "label": "sdc01_0040_bbteacher_05",
      "hash64": "EC54778D853DFB36",
      "text": "Ich bin übrigens selbst auch zum ersten Mal hier.\\nDie Ländlichkeit ist wahrlich atemberaubend![VAR 0x0114(0042)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 94,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0042"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 8,
      "label": "sdc01_0040_bbteacher_06",
      "hash64": "EC54768D853DF983",
      "text": "Vor uns liegt das Dorf Midoriya. Es wird uns\\nquasi als Basis dienen.[VAR 0x0114(0042)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 68,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0042"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 9,
      "label": "sdc01_0040_student3_01",
      "hash64": "6765878E822BE528",
      "text": "Ms Brianna... Mir geht’s nicht so gut...",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 10,
      "label": "sdc01_0040_bbteacher_07",
      "hash64": "EC54758D853DF7D0",
      "text": "Oje, du Ärmster. Das wird wohl die\\nReisekrankheit sein.[VAR 0x0114(0042)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 55,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0042"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 11,
      "label": "sdc01_0040_bbteacher_08",
      "hash64": "EC54848D853E114D",
      "text": "Dann lasst uns erst einmal eine Pause einlegen\\nund die schöne Landschaft genießen.[VAR 0x0114(0042)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 82,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0042"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 12,
      "label": "sdc01_0040_bbteacher_09",
      "hash64": "EC54838D853E0F9A",
      "text": "[VAR 0xBD06(0000)][VAR 0x0100(0000)], dürfte ich dich um\\neinen\\r\\nGefallen\\r\\nbitten?[VAR 0x0114(0042)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 0,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "BD06",
          "args_hex": [
            "0000"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 4,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0100",
          "args_hex": [
            "0000"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 34,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 46,
          "count": 1,
